# "At the beginning of the end step, sacrifice this creature." The trigger's controller, Bot1, sacrifices it - and a player
# can't sacrifice a permanent they don't control (CR 701.21a). With the trigger on the stack in Bot1's end step, Bot2 Giant
# Growths Old Man of the Sea (5/6) and takes the 4/4 Frostbite Pyromental with it (Bot2 has controlled Old Man since their
# turn began, CR 302.6). The trigger resolves and sacrifices nothing: the Pyromental is Bot2's. At cleanup Giant Growth ends,
# Old Man's power (2) is less than the Pyromental's, and Bot1 has it back (CR 611.2b).

